* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_ucv (reference/crafted.toml, 14 Nov 2026): unit commitment by
* start-up type (eqlducs.vda L12-124; Version.log 3.9.7), the branches that demo12_uc does not
* reach, added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0). Linear (LP).
* The times are chosen to reach the terms of the equations between timeslices, not to
* describe a real plant.
* - REG2 ELCTNGAS01 (vintaged, PRC_VINT; DAYNITE, two timeslices of about 12 hours in the
*   cycle of a day): start-up times of 3, 9 and 20 hours and a shut-down time of 19 hours
*   (ACT_SDTIME), non-operational times of 10 and 20 hours (ACT_MAXNON), minimum on-line and
*   off-line times of 40 and 14 hours (ACT_TIME), so that the start-up and shut-down phases
*   reach the neighbouring timeslice; efficiency losses of every start-up type and of the
*   shut-down (ACT_LOSSD) with a partial-load loss (ACT_LOSPL FX).
* - REG1 ELCTECOA00 (not vintaged; SEASON, so its start-up level is ANNUAL): times in
*   thousands of hours, because its timeslices are seasons. In demo12 each season is its own
*   cycle of the year (RS_UP), so no term of this plant reaches a neighbouring timeslice.
*   An ACT_LOSSD without ACT_LOSPL FX (eqlducs.vda L39: the default of 1); no shut-down cost
*   or time.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
ACT_UPS ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ANNUAL.FX 0.3
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.ANNUAL.FX 0.3

/

PARAMETER
ACT_MINLD ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01 0.4
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00 0.35

/

PARAMETER
ACT_LOSPL ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.FX 0.05

/

PARAMETER
ACT_TIME ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.UP 40
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.LO 14
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.UP 2500
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.LO 2000

/

PARAMETER
ACT_CSTSD ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.HOT.UP.MEURO05 0.01
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.WARM.UP.MEURO05 0.02
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.COLD.UP.MEURO05 0.04
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.HOT.LO.MEURO05 0.005
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.HOT.UP.MEURO05 0.5
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.WARM.UP.MEURO05 1
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.COLD.UP.MEURO05 2

/

PARAMETER
ACT_SDTIME ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.HOT.UP 3
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.WARM.UP 9
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.COLD.UP 20
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.HOT.LO 19
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.HOT.UP 500
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.WARM.UP 1500
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.COLD.UP 7000

/

PARAMETER
ACT_MAXNON ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.HOT 10
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.WARM 20
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.HOT 1000
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.WARM 3000

/

PARAMETER
ACT_LOSSD ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.HOT.UP 0.2
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.WARM.UP 0.25
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.COLD.UP 0.3
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.HOT.LO 0.2
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.HOT.UP 0.3

/
